<title>USA: Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices fell this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.87 percent, down one basis point from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.78 percent, one lower than last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 6.13 percent, down one.</p>
<p>					Latest Previous Last Date</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.87%    5.88%  4/17/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.78%    5.79%  4/17/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 6.13%    6.14%  4/17/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
